_1057349611323270814_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/908646d960bce9acfd3da911cc26bb43/2026-10/841465478_2183313798899793_2319369790237949330_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e06f39dc3bc7c1161330ae098f131271/2026-10/841533152_2145388773046820_3212687537345835914_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>時代廣場展銷集由即日起至10月12日舉行《Sidefame Warehouse Sale》，全場減價劈至1折起！其中，焦點品牌Marimekko今次的開倉重點落在經典花卉系列，除了杯碟、服飾、手袋、床品布藝，就連帆布鞋款都有減價優惠！不僅色彩豐富，更兼具耐用實用性，平時正價動輒過千的Marimekko，今次開倉簡直是入手好時機！</p>\n<h2>ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起</h2>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68deb6de786a7e79e9d1d673f6ae7b8f/2026-10/825286725_2328552154566088_8571403944669836135_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddddbe58701d368f64e101db36832f98/2026-10/825328808_4770592049819899_8921769793671188372_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1528cc97e9f64d3dac4d39871ce8c55/2026-10/839048883_1648304293671070_4386348750990079463_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/226292efbb2b92cac6465ffcfa0f5ed2/2026-10/839090652_4481132602102765_3197679826960044968_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb0684fc7f0a052a3cee83529aaeffe8/2026-10/839236674_1705461637662945_4849710726671152305_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a25677d0d5cf1ca7fe3ee8e8c79151df/2026-10/839361140_1435962335382640_5985332177100422573_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"ANTEPRIMA/COCKTAIL服飾全場1折起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ecb82157122b8af57c405299295aa09/2026-10/839708361_1463074149076017_888442645998130932_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2d591495cb531fd5ccb1649b272fd5f/2026-10/839843129_1444029817511553_1796547350984221780_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80efafeac9677e0711fde99a2348e828/2026-10/840520150_2860836688079727_1879613916271738028_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c80aad65d45bab70ecde13887408bafd/2026-10/840882710_921917624105761_764522978120292803_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de4631dc7502beeb7a16cc6d47db93d8/2026-10/840908460_2069125350459136_799956551064459077_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b3d1b8aad5db78e8c093f2df8192556/2026-10/840951578_963191086866642_8674021241107843162_n.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87cafbc1586145430e35231fd8a0e76e/2026-10/842005586_1414778043448672_1924043919104915072_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>此外，意大利品牌ANTEPRIMA、ATSURO TAYAMA帶來簡約優雅的男女裝系列，剪裁精準、用料舒適，適合上班或休閒斯文穿搭場合。至於COCKTAIL等其他品牌亦同步推出優惠，全場減價1折起，讓不同風格的消費者都有合心水選擇。</p>\n<p>Sidefame Warehouse Sale</p>\n<ul>\n<li>日期：即日起至10月12日</li>\n<li>時間：上午11:00至晚上8:00</li>\n<li>地點：香港銅鑼灣時代廣場一座16樓</li>\n</ul>\n<p>文:R</p>\n<p>資料及圖片來源:Times Square Bazaar 時代廣場展銷集</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T09:58:42.599188+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":650,"images":37,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}